    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BARRY AUCTIONEERS & VALUERS are delighted to present this superb  property to the market. This pristine house which is in  show house condition has four bedrooms, three bathrooms, and beautiful rear garden.\r\n\r\nThe family home is situated in the exclusive Crawford Gate development which is minutes walk from all the amenities, services, and opportunities of Blackrock and Mahon Point and is bordered by the delightful Blackrock Greenway. Constructed in 2020 with energy efficiency at its core, an A2 energy rating ensures reduced energy consumption and lower utility costs as well as been eligible for a green rate mortgage. \r\nThe home features pristine living and dining areas, fully fitted kitchen, and private rear garden. Additionally, they come equipped with cobble lock driveways, enhancing curb appeal and providing convenient off-street parking.\r\n\r\nThe property would suit for a first-time buyer or equally someone trading up in the area. The location couldn't be better, being situated in one of Corks most sought-after locations. \r\nViewing is a must to fully appreciate."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Ground floor: Entrance Hall: - \r\nPorcelain tile flooring.  Alarm panel\r\n\r\nGuest WC: - \r\nWC & WHB with tiled flooring.\n\r\n\r\nPlant Room: - \r\nSeparate plant room with cold water fill tank and hot water cylinder.\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 5.0m x 3.6m \r\nSpacious living room with views over the front of property. There is beautiful laminate flooring, modern decorative electric fire  and a large window with plantation shutters.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room: - 5.16m x 3.6m \r\nWonderful, modern kitchen with floor and eye level cupboards and island unit.  Ceramic hob with extractor fan,  fridge freezer.  Eye level oven with integrated microwave. Island unit with breakfast bar, sink and drainer, wine fridge, integrated dishwasher and electric sockets. Modern overhead light features. Laminate timber flooring and French doors to patio area and rear garden.\r\n\r\nUtility Area - 1.7m x 1.3m \r\nPlumbed for washing machine and dryer with counter top.\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR Bedroom 1: - 4.5m x 2.8m \r\nBright double bedroom with window overlooking the front of property.  Built in wardrobes, laminate flooring and plantation shutters.\n\r\n\r\nEnsuite Bathroom: - \r\nSpacious ensuite with integrated pressurized shower, WC and wash hand basin.  Tiled floor and shower surrounds.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: - 3.6m x 3.0m \r\nSpacious double bedroom with built in wardrobes laminate flooring, window overlooking the rear garden with plantation shutters.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: - 2.7m x 2.1m \r\nSingle bedroom with laminate flooring, window overlooking the rear of property with plantation shutter. Currently used as office with built in desk. \n\r\n\r\nBedroom 4: - 3.7m x 2.0m \r\nLaminate flooring, window overlooking the front  of property with plantation shutters. currently laid out as large walk in wardrobe.\n\r\n\r\nBathroom: - \r\n3 Piece suite with tiled floor and bath surround and frosted window overlooking side of property.\r\n\r\nHot Press: - \r\nShelved storage Cupboard\n\r\n\r\nAttic: - \r\n Large area floored for storage with stira stairs access.\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE Front Garden: - \r\nThe front garden has parking for 2 cars and is finished with brick paving.\r\n\r\nRear Garden: - \r\nThis has a delightful patio area with pergolo and garden shed.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
